### API overview
GET http://localhost:8080/api

### Available scenarios
GET http://localhost:8080/api/scenarios

### Run a matching transaction
POST http://localhost:8080/api/scenarios/matched

### Run an amount mismatch
POST http://localhost:8080/api/scenarios/amount-mismatch

### Run a duplicate payment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/scenarios/duplicate-payment

### List recent reconciliation outcomes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/reconciliations

### Clear the demo result projection
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/reconciliations

### Engine metrics
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/metrics/ledgerguard.reconciliations

### Prometheus scrape endpoint
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/prometheus
